# spec_id: eravos.embodiment-lab · version 1.0.0 · status built · template eravos.tool/1 (sound flavour)
identity:
  id: eravos.embodiment-lab ; label: Embodiment Lab ; domain: music ; category: embodiment (shown in Lab mode as Xenharmonic)
  purpose: sound to come back into your body — an irrational-ratio drone, a body pulse, a breath swell and attention cues.
  claims: NONE. A listening and grounding experience; never described as treatment or therapy.
ports:
  in:  audio-less · note_in (a played note moves the root; when stopped, a note begins it) · transport_in (tempo lock)
       mod breath (from a Breath tool, when "Breath from" = wired)
  out: audio out (soft ceiling ≤ 0.72) · mod breath (its own breath 0..1) · event embody:cue {text, region, index, cycle, time}
params (groups): DRONE rootNote ratioSet(φ golden, √2, √3, π/2, e/2, 2^(1/φ), golden stack) tone(pure|warm|organ)
  brightness drift grit sub · PULSE pulse pulseShape(heartbeat|throb|chop) pulseLock(free|beat|1/8) pulseRate ·
  BREATH clock(own|wired) inhale hold exhale rest breathDepth breathFilter · ATTENTION cues cueEvery ·
  SPACE space stereo beat · OUTPUT fade level glow
behaviour:
  - ▶ Begin fades in over `fade` s and starts the breath clock; ■ End fades out; Stop all ends it at once
  - the breath (own clock or wired) swells level by breathDepth and opens the filter by breathFilter
  - the pulse is an exact Fourier-shaped LFO (heartbeat / throb / chop); free pulses quicken slightly on the inhale
  - every `cueEvery` breaths a cue moves attention up the body: feet → legs → belly → chest → throat → face → whole
  - ratio / tone changes crossfade to a rebuilt voice; root changes glide
packs: accepts [presets] · ships [feelings]: Grounded · Held · Heavy Heart · Ache · Longing · Wonder · Release · Awake ·
  Safe · Calm Fire · Hanging Tree
ui: breathing light + phase words · body silhouette lit at the cued region · cue text · feelings chips · Begin/End ·
  level · deeper (every param) · living accents
acceptance (tests/p20-embodiment-lab.test.js):
  - after Begin the output is non-silent and its peak ≤ 0.9
  - breath period: envelope minima spacing = in + hold + out + rest (±10 %)
  - cues advance one region per cueEvery breaths and are emitted as embody:cue
  - every Feelings preset loads and renders without clipping
  - End fades to silence

# ---- dependencies (generated by build/specs.mjs — do not edit by hand)
dependencies:
  mode: music.lab   # Lab
  toolbar_units: [music.engine, music.transport, music.tempo, music.meter]   # ui expansion when added: Audio engine · Transport · Tempo · Master meter
  services:
    - audio: Audio engine — makes sound
    - clock: Master clock & tempo — locks to the beat
    - mod: 1 modulation input — LFO / XY / Macro can move them
    - notes: Notes from a sequencer, timeline or keys — or play its own keyboard
  inputs:
    - embodiment-lab.hook.note_in (note:trigger)
    - embodiment-lab.hook.transport_in (transport:tick|transport:play|transport:stop) — ambient broadcast
    - embodiment-lab.hook.breath_in (modulation · port mod.breath)
  outputs:
    - embodiment-lab.hook.audio_out (audio · port out)
    - embodiment-lab.hook.breath_out (modulation · port breath)
    - embodiment-lab.hook.cue_out (embody:cue)
  permissions: [audio_out, bus_publish, bus_subscribe]
  works_with: [eravos.breath, eravos.organ, eravos.xen-synth, eravos.timeline, eravos.sequencer, eravos.midi-mapper, eravos.lyric-rhythm, eravos.ratio-lattice]
  notes:
    - Keep the volume comfortable and low. Stop whenever you like.
